# Google service-account keys (Settings -> Integrations -> Google Sheets
# sync) must never be committed - this repo is public (see tauri.conf.json's
# unauthenticated updater endpoint). The real key only ever reaches the app
# via the GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON GitHub Actions secret at CI build time
# (see src-tauri/build.rs) - it is never read from a file in this tree. These
# patterns are just a safety net in case a downloaded key file is ever
# dropped into the project folder for local testing.
*service-account*.json
*service_account*.json
credentials.json
google-credentials.json
